# status.pet — timer, download, battery. Derived from base.pet `sit`.
# Clock: 5x5 round, g rim, z 3x3 face, k hands (centre + hour hand up, minute hand sweeps),
#   k corner pixels; held under the chin (rows 9-13) with cream paws at cols 3 and 9,
#   raised 1 row over the chin for alert/done (paws stay at rows 10-11).
# Package: 6x5 incl. k outline, interior nWWn/nWWn/NNNN (W tape, N shaded base). Carried between the ears
#   with the head lowered 1 row (sit_breathe); set down bottom-left for download_done.
# Plug: g prongs + 3x2 g body at cols 13-15 rows 6-8 (k outline where there is room), G cable running diagonally behind the back.
# Happy face (download_done, full_charge) = react.pet happy: ^ ^ eyes + pp mouth row 8 (timer_done's raised clock covers the mouth).
# Effects: Y zigzag bolt cols 13-15 rows 0-4; Y+z sparkle rows 0-2; r "!" col 14; b drop cols 14-15.

